ISO-10303-21;
HEADER;
/*
  Component:  ISO 7380-1 - M4 x 16
  Standard:   ISO 7380-1:2022
  Family:     button head hexagon socket screw
  Size:       M4
  Length:     16 mm
  Data source: ISO 7380-1 button head table; nominal values transcribed from published summaries, see components/DATA_SOURCES.md
  Notes:      Button head with a spherical-cap dome, flat top, and hexagon socket. The dome is an analytic spherical surface; the socket band is a high-resolution polygon with a real hex through-hole. No thread geometry is modeled.
*/
